# The Islandora Lite site is its own repository (digitalutsc/islandora-lite-site),
# cloned here by `make lite-site`. Never commit it into this repo.
drupal/rootfs/var/www/drupal/

# Production-site replicas: each lite/sites/<site>/ is a local working folder (make site-add).
sites/*
!sites/_template/
!sites/README.md

# Production Cantaloupe config (manual input) and what intake generates from it.
cantaloupe/conf/
cantaloupe/stage/
